# The Mac's apps, the everyday CLIs, and three more CLIs kept as casks (1password-cli, gcloud-cli and ngrok). Runtimes and chezmoi are mise's;
# mise is its own installer's (~/.local/bin); git is Xcode's. Apply never upgrades; upkeep does, nightly, leaving
# apps that update themselves to it and quitting none. When this file changes, apply uninstalls
# whatever it does not name.

# ── CLIs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Formulae, for the man pages that mise's installs lack.
brew "fd"
brew "gh"
brew "jq"
brew "neovim"
brew "ripgrep"

# ── 1Password CLI + desktop ───────────────────────────────────────────
cask "1password-cli"
cask "1password"

# ── Apps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
